{"articleNo":"489549","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=489549&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC3.0] 취업 역량강화 캠프 「LINC3.0 페스티벌」","writer":"산학기획실","writeDate":"2024.06.07","hit":"4457","attachments":[{"name":"붙임. 한동대학교 취업역량강화캠프 「LINC3.0 페스티벌」 운영 계획 및 참가신청서(최종).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=489549&attachNo=135110"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2024년&nbsp;LINC&nbsp;3.0&nbsp;사업의&nbsp;일환으로 대구경북LINC3.0사업협의회(DG9+협의회) 소속 대학에서 진행하는 취업 역량강화 캠프 「LINC3.0 페스티벌」 프로그램&nbsp;운영을 다음과&nbsp;같이&nbsp;시행하고자&nbsp;하오니&nbsp;많은&nbsp;참여&nbsp;바랍니다.</span></p><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: 굴림; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1. 프로그램 운영내용</span></p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px